  <title>Turnkey Villa Construction Cost Calculator | Luxury Homes of India</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Calculate your luxury villa construction cost in Chennai live. Customize plot area, floors, finish packages, and smart home add-ons for instant estimates." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://luxuryhomesofindia.in/cost-calculator.html" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <meta name="keywords" content="Construction Cost Calculator Chennai, Turnkey Villa Pricing, House Construction Cost Tamil Nadu, Luxury Home Cost Estimator" />

